  "comparator_definitions": {
    "A": "New fourth-second clip models versus retained historical repeated-first-frame and dynamic models. Four repetitions construct 32 frames; three fitted seeds. Hardware/software differences and the motion confound remain.",
    "B_predicted_task": "Original dynamic Core A 120-class Top-1 predictions replace the true task token in seven fixed pretrained Core B conditions. Inference and scoring are rerun; no new Core B training. Unsupported classes cause abstention, with no true-label fallback.",
    "B_experts": "15 fresh downstream V0 experts versus 3 fresh shared V0 models in the same environment. Original seed initializations, frozen encoder, 160 epochs, no context dropout. The primary comparison uses this new shared control; historical V0 is secondary context only. Total capacity and optimizer-update budgets differ."
  },
